          "name": "Out Orbit Yaw",
          "type": "Float&"
        },
        {
          "name": "Out Orbit Zoom",
          "type": "Float&"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Gets parameters to create a view matrix to be used by CreateView(). Implemented in children classes.\n@param InFOVDegrees  The FOV used to display the thumbnail. Often used to calculate the output parameters.\n@param OutOrigin\t The origin of the orbit view. Typically the center of the bounds of the target object.\n@param OutOrbitPitch The pitch of the orbit cam around the object.\n@param OutOrbitYaw\t The yaw of the orbit cam around the object.\n@param OutOrbitZoom  The camera distance from the object."
